# [CRIT] "neat, angular, and faintly tremulous, as though written by a man whose nerves were frayed by secrets he dared not speak" — INVENTION: "neat, angular," "tremulous," and the entire inference about the annotator's psychological state ("nerves frayed by secrets") are added.
# [CRIT] "rose like ossified records" — LOADED EMBELLISHMENT: "ossified" adds a metaphorical claim of death/permanence beyond "stacks of older filings."
